      "content": "it just feels pointless. every day is the same. i wake up, i look at his side of the bed, and i just feel this intense ache in my chest like i'm suffocating. i just want to be able to talk to him again. i miss him so much it actually hurts to breathe. i don't see the point in any of this anymore.",
